  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ZIMTRADE Institutional Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ZimTrade as a Trade Promotion Organisation (TPO) needs skills development in the area of research so that material produced for trade advisory services is up-to-date, relevant and addresses the needs of its clientele. Currently, although, ZimTrade has been executing this service, there is a clear lack of skills in how this information is gathered, analysed, packaged and disseminated for it to be impactful.  This project will upskill the TPO staff enabling them to be more efficient and effective in its service delivery and development of exports from Zimbabwe.</narrative>
  </description>
